+### W-20261024-FE-15-1 — UI design system v2
+- Date: 2026-10-24 · Agent: Claude (review session with the owner) · Branch: main (local commits, not pushed) · Commit: 97ad04d, 691e6d3
+- Tasks: FE-15 (added) [ ]→[x]; FE-16 (added) opened
+- Outcome: PARTIAL (design system and shell done; visual QA of every page pending)
+- What changed and why: The UI looked flat and "childish". The PrimeVue preset and `--ds-*` tokens were redesigned so all three apps change together: brand teal #01bec2 + deep blue #003a54, cool neutral surfaces, a real dark scheme, visible focus ring, navy-tinted shadows, calmer shapes. White on #01bec2 is 2.30:1 (fails WCAG AA), so the light-theme action color is the deeper shade #00797f (white 5.20:1); dark theme uses bright teal with deep-blue text (5.28:1). Added `BrandMark` logo, navy sidebar, deep-blue public hero, token-based footer/auth panels/ContactUs.
+- Files: `packages/shared-ui/theme.js`, `assets/design-system/tokens.scss`, `components/common/BrandMark.vue`, `components/dashboard/DashboardSidebar.vue`, `apps/website/src/{layouts/PublicLayout.vue,pages/public/{Home,Login,Register,ContactUs}.vue}`.
+- Verification: three app builds pass; `sessionHandoff` tests 18/18. NOT VERIFIED: any screen in a real browser; light/dark visual QA.
+- Behavior change / IMPACT: visual only. No API, auth or routing change.
+- Decisions made or proposed: action-color shade #00797f is a proposal (owner had not chosen between options A/B/C).
+- Follow-ups / blockers: FE-16. Push to GitHub blocked: no credentials in the sandbox.
